Your method: Using your reputation, technological mystique, and a little magician's theatre to make him reconsider his behavior. That's where things get ethically complicated.
Your alternative: You believe you might have escalated considerably had the behavior continued. I understand that frustration, but the possibility of doing something worse doesn't automatically make the lesser action moral.
